# DHI-11 V6 — Verification, warning diagnosis and project learnings

Completed development formula and pour card; physical/safety/release state **HOLD**. This record interprets the unchanged current diagnostic, not a new pipeline run.

## Actual current result

**108 PASS / 34 WARN / 3 FAIL / 1 SKIP** across 146 reported gates. The separate formal DHP donor gate is **NOT RUN / HOLD** and is not included in those 146. The exact stock binding, six-group architecture-only contract and G15 immediate-parent guard pass. All 33 rows bind; minimum raw transfer10 µL; concentrate6,000 µL and final diluent24,000 µL.

Report: [current diagnostic](C:/Users/ASUS/.codex/worktrees/c4d5/perfume-chem/output/dhi2011_v6_complexity_first_20260906/release_gate.json). SHA-256: a08fb0e7154bcdbe843a9c64fcf0128880015693259009a34bb30756ec78ed72. Formula semantic SHA-256: 2d987040e98e6a2295a93df8e8cd139455465a066acc5f3c9a95938fca0fbe6c. Immediate V5 semantic SHA-256: 279ba9f447847b63313b151bb0d5b059b10c160305947d514739ba3617c27232.

The full standalone formatter is in the master and was shown in chat. The bound release-renderer transcript is also retained, because the two renderers currently order sections differently. Original report bytes and the exact original binding manifest are preserved.

## Three failures — causes and disposition

| Gate | Reported failure | Decision |
|---|---|---|
| pipeline_preflight | 13 checks; 8 warnings | Aggregate includes missing Orris composite plus eight evidence warnings; arithmetic and stock checks passed. |
| natural_composite_coverage | Natural mixtures lack required composite GC-O decomposition: Orris Liquid | Need lot-qualified Orris composition/GC-O support or accept continued unknown; do not fabricate constituents. |
| opaque_preblends | not allowed: Tonkarome | Need product composition/safety evidence; no preblend waiver was used. |

These are evidence failures, not three observed bad smells. They are not waived. No skin use or release is authorized.

