Skipped: **chassis_integrity** — No chassis annotations detected — not applicable to flat formulas.. A skip is not a pass.

## Specific reporting problems found

- The master-perfumer gate warns at **more than32 rows**, independent of demonstrated mixture readability. It is not a scientific32-material ceiling and does not override this user's no-count-cap brief. The code is unchanged; the raw warning is preserved.
- The five-marker skeleton demands modeled OAV≥1 and misses Ambrettolide at0.55. The separate six-marker contract checks architectural representation. A stock can be represented while its modeled role is weak; neither result establishes what a person smells.
- Five natural VP entries are labelled conflicts. Vetiver has unequal bulk values; Carrot Seed, cedar and coriander have equal compared values, and lavender has only one listed bulk source. Those four remain natural-proxy uncertainty, but are not demonstrated cross-source numerical disagreements.
- The formatter labels some rows STRUCTURAL_OR_FIXATIVE from generic profiles. V6 assigns sensory roles to14 of its15 sub-threshold rows, including the musks, salicylates and creamy modifiers. Generic fixative classification does not absolve those roles. Only Benzyl Benzoate has no audible-role burden in this design.
- Internal confidence8/100 is evidence quality, not beauty8%, failure probability or predicted liking. Receptor percentage caps, erogenic categories, low-VP depth labels and cost defaults do not become validated sensory or medical conclusions because the code prints them.
- The first artifact check caught loss of the original manifest's number serialization through PowerShell/JavaScript; restoring the original JSON string fixed the binding without a formula change. The next check identified the different renderer ordering; both exact outputs are now preserved. These were artifact-assembly findings, not changes to perfumery or threshold data.

## Every row's post-screen survival decision

All33 remain in this **development hypothesis**, not in a sensory-approved winner. None has accepted audible-layer credit yet. For OAV below one, use the row's explicit omission/alternative test; do not increase doses just to pass a threshold. For unknown products, qualify composition instead of substituting a fabricated single-molecule OAV. Whole-mixture quality remains unknown.

